- Used by the height graph: no

## Feature summary (web, SideFX reference)

- Source: https://www.sidefx.com/docs/houdini/nodes/cop/sdfshape.html
- Summary (EN): SDF Shape builds a 2D signed distance field for a selected shape, negative inside and positive outside. Its Mono output can be combined with SDF Blend, or converted with SDF to Mono or SDF to RGB.
- Résumé (FR) : Le nœud SDF Shape construit un champ de distance signé 2D pour une forme choisie, négatif à l'intérieur et positif à l'extérieur.

- Inputs meaning: ["size_ref: sets the output image size and metadata (the only input)"]

- Key parameters: ["Shape Class: Basic, Marker or Compound", "Basic shapes: Circle (Radius, Arc, Thickness, Round Ends, Quadratic Circle); Diamond and Rectangle (Size, Rectangle adds Round Corners and Separate Controls); Line (Length, Use Points, Add Thickness, Bulge); Polygon and Star (Radius, Number of Sides, Star adds Angle Factor); Spiral (Radius, Arc Bend, Number of Arcs); Squircle (Radius, Blend); Trapezoid (Height, Bottom Length, Top Length); Triangle (Width, Height, or Points 0 to 2); Wave (Arc, Element Size)", "Marker: Size, the radius of the marker", "Compound: Arch, Arrow, Cross, Egg, Fishscale, Horseshoe, Moon, Octagon-Dot, Vesica, each with its own controls", "Transform: Translate, Rotate, Shear, Uniform Scale"]

- Caveats: ["The node shows the field through a visualizer by default; add a Layer Properties node with Type Info on and set to None to read the raw values"]

